@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:VmType a owl:Class .
hpc:vmType a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:VmType ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .


This ontology fragment defines a class `Vm_Type` and a datatype property `vm_type` for string resources representing different virtual machine types.
